{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"一、二年。春王正月，葬簡王。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"二、鄭師伐宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"三、夏五月庚寅，夫人姜氏薨。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"四、六月庚辰，鄭伯睔卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"五、晉師、宋師、衞寧殖侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"六、秋七月，仲孫蔑會晉荀罃、宋華元、衞孫林父、曹人、邾婁人于戚。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"七、己丑，葬我小君齊姜。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"齊姜者何？齊姜與繆姜則未知其為宣夫人與？成夫人與？","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"八、叔孫豹如宋。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"九、冬，仲孫蔑會晉荀罃、齊崔杼、宋華元、衞孫林父、曹人、邾婁人、滕人、薛人、小邾婁人于戚，遂城虎牢。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"虎牢者何？鄭之邑也。其言城之何？取之也。取之則曷為不言取之？為中國諱也。曷為為中國諱？諱伐喪也。曷為不繫乎鄭？為中國諱也。大夫無遂事，此其言遂何？歸惡乎大夫也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_152_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_152","textTraditional":"十、楚殺其大夫公子申。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}